<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) beat 12-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Add women's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 14-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S) 6-1 6-3  </p>
<p>Men's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 7-5 6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
